{"at":0.7,"end":22,"text":"The Day of Resurrection! Let us be illumined, O ye people! The Passover, the Passover of the Lord! From death unto life, and from earth unto heaven hath Christ our God brought us over, singing a song of victory!","words":[[0.7,1.42],[1.42,1.8],[1.8,2.86],[2.86,3.82],[3.82,4.14],[4.14,4.4],[4.4,4.82],[4.82,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,6.7],[6.7,7.56],[7.56,7.86],[7.86,8.38],[8.38,8.74],[8.74,8.96],[8.96,9.04],[9.04,9.12],[9.12,10.8],[10.8,11.4],[11.4,13.72],[13.72,14.3],[14.3,14.62],[14.62,14.92],[14.92,15.2],[15.2,15.52],[15.52,16.34],[16.34,17.44],[17.44,17.7],[17.7,17.92],[17.92,18],[18,18.08],[18.08,18.16],[18.16,18.24],[18.24,18.32],[18.32,18.4],[18.4,18.48],[18.48,18.82],[18.82,19.8],[19.8,21.96]],"unheard":[0,7,9,11,12,14,15,16,17,20,25,27,28,29,30,31,32,33,34,35,38]},
{"at":26.5,"end":45.4,"text":"Let us purify our senses and we shall behold Christ, radiant with the light ineffable of the Resurrection, and shall hear him say, in accents clear: Rejoice! as we sing the song of victory.","words":[[26.5,26.64],[26.64,27.14],[27.14,27.22],[27.22,27.54],[27.54,28],[28,28.28],[28.28,29.14],[29.14,29.22],[29.22,30.2],[30.2,30.62],[30.62,30.7],[30.7,31],[31,31.08],[31.08,31.68],[31.68,35.1],[35.1,35.68],[35.68,36.76],[36.76,38.06],[38.06,38.44],[38.44,39.1],[39.1,39.66],[39.66,39.92],[39.92,40.24],[40.24,40.32],[40.32,40.4],[40.4,40.48],[40.48,41.1],[41.1,41.32],[41.32,41.62],[41.62,41.9],[41.9,42.18],[42.18,42.46],[42.46,43.42],[43.42,45.36]],"unheard":[1,2,3,5,7,9,10,11,14,23,24,25,31]},
