{"at":1079.9,"end":1088.4,"text":"Jesus having risen from the grave, as he foretold, hath given unto us life eternal, and great mercy.","words":[[1079.9,1079.98],[1079.98,1080.12],[1080.12,1080.46],[1080.46,1080.62],[1080.62,1080.94],[1080.94,1081.1],[1081.1,1081.28],[1081.28,1081.48],[1081.48,1082.64],[1082.64,1083.3],[1083.3,1083.54],[1083.54,1083.98],[1083.98,1084.4],[1084.4,1084.6],[1084.6,1085.44],[1085.44,1085.68],[1085.68,1086.2],[1086.2,1088.4]],"unheard":[0,9,10,11,14]},
